### 作业与实验模块 API 测试（节选）
### 将 courseId / homeworkId / labSetId 替换为 seed 数据中的实际 id

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
@teacherToken = {{loginTeacher.response.body.token}}
@courseId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000001001c

### TC-HW-001 学生查看我的作业
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-HW-002 教师教学台作业概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/teaching
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### TC-HW-003 课程内作业列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/homework
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-LAB-001 学生实验总览
GET {{baseUrl}}/lab-sets/mine/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-LAB-002 课程实验集列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lab-sets
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-LAB-003 提交代码评测（需 judge-worker + Redis；Windows 建议测 JS 题）
@labId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000001003d
POST {{baseUrl}}/labs/{{labId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "console.log(\"Hello\")",
  "language": "javascript"
}

### TC-HW-004 迟交提交（seed fixture，已截止 + allowLate）
@lateHomeworkId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000090010
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/{{lateHomeworkId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "TC-HW-004 迟交测试提交。"
}

### TC-HW-005 重做申请（seed fixture）
@redoHomeworkId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000090011
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/{{redoHomeworkId}}/redo-request
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "HTTP 测试重做申请"
}

### TC-LAB-002 未开始实验集（seed fixture，overview 含「未开始」分组）
@futureLabSetId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000090020
@futureLabId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000090021
GET {{baseUrl}}/lab-sets/mine/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 预期 403 不可提交
POST {{baseUrl}}/labs/{{futureLabId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "console.log('x')\n",
  "language": "javascript"
}

### TC-LAB-007 已打回提交（seed fixture）
@returnedSubmissionId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000090024
GET {{baseUrl}}/submissions/{{returnedSubmissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
